=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Talon_258c65.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a talon.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.20 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">There are many rumours about these magic gems.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Talons add a nice touch to house decorations, and many \"richer\" players might be interested in buying some at higher prices.\n</p><p>Can be obtained through Paradox Quest, <a href=\"#/quest/giant-smithhammer-quest\">Giant Smithhammer Quest</a> and <a href=\"#/quest/parchment-room-quest\">Parchment Room Quest</a>. One spawns under a heap of corpses in the single <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a> hole in <a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc\">Plains of Havoc</a>. One also spawns <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32583,32137,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32583, 32137, 8)</a> in a hole in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Jakundaf%20Desert\">Jakundaf Desert</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Angry%20Demon\">Angry Demon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Anmothra\">Anmothra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthom%20the%20Hunter\">Arthom the Hunter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Defiler\">Defiler</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Devourer\">Devourer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras\">Ferumbras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghazbaran\">Ghazbaran</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Irahsae\">Irahsae</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Latrivan\">Latrivan</a></li>\n<li><a href